  "sampleSentence": "Cyprazepam is a drug which is a sedative-hypnotic benzodiazepine derivative.",
  "fullTextRaw": "Cyprazepam is a drug which is a sedative-hypnotic benzodiazepine derivative. It has anxiolytic properties, and presumably also has hypnotic, skeletal muscle relaxant, anticonvulsant and amnestic properties.\n\nThe lactam moiety in benzodiazepams is active towards nucleophiles and numerous analogues have been made by exploiting this fact.\n\nFor example, heating demoxepam with N-cyclopropylmethylamine leads to amidine formation, the minor tranquilizer cyprazepam.",
  "categoriesList": [
    "General"
  ],
